    "detailed_description": "In this real time strategy game, defeat your friends by destroying their castle. The last player with their castle still standing wins!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers must manage their economy, build their base and defenses, while producing and upgrading their units.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild:<br />\r\n  -House: generates money<br />\r\n  -Forge: generates iron and upgrades your army's armor (3 different armor types: blunt, piercing, and slashing)<br />\r\n  -Pillar: generates magic and enchants targeted unit, so that they bypass enemy non-magic armor.<br />\r\n  -Barracks: recruit and upgrade soldier soldier<br />\r\n  -Archery range: recruits and upgrades archers<br />\r\n  -Foundry: recruits and upgrades canons<br />\r\n  -Wizard tower: recruits and upgrades wizards.<br />\r\n -Defensive Tower: shoots 3 arrows at enemies in the vicinity.<br />\r\n -Walls: blocks unit movement.<br />\r\n -Gate: A wall that can let units go through <br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduce your army from a range of 4 different units: <br />\r\n   -Archer: attacks from afar with piercing damage but are more accurate at close range.<br />\r\n   -Soldier: attacks with slashing damage, have higher HP and armor and can change their weapon type to counter their opponent's armor-type<br />\r\n   -Canon: attacks from a long range causing blunt  damage, effective at taking down enemy defenses.<br />\r\n   -Wizard: attacks from medium-range, causing blunt damage and can cast powerful fireballs and defensive shields at the cost of MP.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your army:  -There are 3 types of armor upgrades (blunt, piercing, slashing) available to your army, try to upgrade the right ones to counter your opponent's army.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  -You can also level up your army's units, which will improve their attack power and max health<br />\r\n  -the cost of upgrades depends on the number of units you own.",
